to the test

00:00:08.974 --> 00:00:11.877
and play a little game called
"One Song, Many Artists."

00:00:11.877 --> 00:00:13.613
The way it works is,
we're gonna pick a song.

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:16.349
You'll start singing.
I'll hold up a name.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:17.817
You'll sing it in that voice,

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:20.219
and then as the song goes on,
I'll pick up a different name,

00:00:20.219 --> 00:00:22.688
and you'll change your voice
and sing it as that person.

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:24.924
Is that okay?
-That sounds good to me, man.

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:26.593
-The song you'll be singing is

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:29.095
"You're Nobody
Till Somebody Loves You."

